    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Genesis 1:22 — “Be fruitful, and multiply, and fill the waters in the seas.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "Acts 6:7 — “The word of God increased; and the number of the disciples multiplied.”",
